{"schema_version":1,"event_id":"bob-cli-a0.2.1:000050:note_appended:bob-cli-a0.2.1.6:f56b2733bd4f73a5f329607d2a6d4e9f87bf857216545fc70cbe5e94a5ae023c","timestamp":"2026-10-20T00:37:02Z","actor":"bob-cli-a0.2.1.6","operation":"note_appended","issue_id":"bob-cli-a0.2.1.6","payload":{"kind":"note_appended","entry":"Integration complete. Added bob-docs check and themed just docs-check, with one assembled source context threaded through lint, strict build, URLs, lychee, and search smoke; production --sources is forwarded once. Added the two required search cases and tests for Zensical docs and items index formats, malformed/empty/missing indexes, location boundaries, punctuation, gate order, production context reuse, and generated drift. Verification: just docs-check passed all gates and 121 tests; just docs-build-material passed. Versions: Python 3.12.13, bob-docs 0.1.0, Zensical 0.0.71, Material 9.7.7, MkDocs 1.6.1, lychee 0.24.2. Evidence: 27 contracts, 32 published pages, 352 URL mentions; live /urls.txt returned first-publish 404 warning. Injected ../missing-injected-doc.md failed strict build with vault-git-sync.md:370:26 and target; injected #missing-injected-anchor failed URLs with source line and target. Production fixture tests pass clean SHA and reject dirty, wrong SHA, missing entry, env override, and wrong bob-cli path. Follow-on CLI golden, tutorial, media gates print explicit not-implemented skips. git diff --check passed; no generated tracked drift; just check recipe remains unchanged and no Rust files changed."}}
